Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.71,0:00:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:01:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.23,0:01:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.65,0:01:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you\Nif you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.03,0:01:54.95,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(684,726,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,790)}Enter: Captain Usopp
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.03,0:01:54.95,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(720,790)}Enter: Captain Usopp
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.93,0:02:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely no way we'll make\Nit to the Grand Line in this condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.89,0:02:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, we're going to\Nneed a whole lot more meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eating fruit every day is for the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll also need some booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you boneheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line's a dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.71,0:02:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need more than beer\Nand meat to survive there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the place is crawling with
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.53,0:02:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates who are also in\Nsearch of the one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they all have ships that\Nare way better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we don't have a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.49,0:02:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have a crew, we\Ndon't have any equipment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or even a real ship for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no way we'll\Never make it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, we'll need a cook, and maybe\Na musician to keep us entertained?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A musician?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little to the south of here is an\Nisland with some settlements on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.75,0:02:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it looks like we\Nmight be able to get our
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ship and some of the\Nsupplies we need there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.85,0:02:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh meat at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of booze as well
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound the alarm! They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here and they're\Ngonna kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.91,0:03:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Pirates! Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.87,0:03:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are attacking! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run for your\Nlives! Pirates! Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their bloodlust is unquenchable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirates are...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.63,0:03:37.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,477)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\t(3273,3315,\1a&HFF&)}Usopp\NA Village Youngster
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.63,0:03:37.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,477)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\t(3273,3315,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Usopp\NA Village Youngster
Dialogue: 3,0:03:33.63,0:03:37.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,477)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Usopp\NA Village Youngster
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna get away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.05,0:03:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.87,0:03:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try and catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, slowpokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he got away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's a Newgate troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd better hope I\Nnever get a hold of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like nobody's getting\Na hold of him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yet another job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.11,0:04:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my solemn duty to send the wind of\Nexcitement through this boring old village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bid you, good morning, captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not, your loyal crew, the\NUsopp Pirates, have arrived!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.11,0:04:43.45,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Carrot and Pepper\NVillage Boys
Dialogue: 2,0:04:40.11,0:04:43.45,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Carrot and Pepper\NVillage Boys
Dialogue: 3,0:04:40.11,0:04:43.45,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Carrot and Pepper\NVillage Boys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper! Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Onion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen him around today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound the alarm! They're\Nhere! They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:05:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here and they're\Ngonna kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.89,0:05:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's freaking out about?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.93,0:05:09.85,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(477,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,477,\1a&H00&)}Onion\NA Village Boy
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.93,0:05:09.85,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(477,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(436,477,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Onion\NA Village Boy
Dialogue: 3,0:05:03.93,0:05:09.85,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(477,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Onion\NA Village Boy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.94,0:05:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.68,0:05:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bloodthirsty murderers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Lincoln run, everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.11,0:05:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for me to have my snack! You chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm sick! Yeah, I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll die if I don't eat my snackiosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always told us that\Nyou wanted to become
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a real pirate someday\Nand now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of a pirate is\Nafraid of other pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly, it\Nwas Buggy the Clown's mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I only saw two tiny boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there were just three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's go time, brave Usa pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do have a village to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, men! Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feels good to be on dry land again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.27,0:06:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a village around\Nhere somewhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a small one, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be a place to\Neat meat in this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just forget about meat\Nfor a minute, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're being watched. Huh?\NBy who? Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.81,0:06:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.01,0:07:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this supposed to be\Nwhen we're impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.91,0:07:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Usopp, leader of the invincible nation\Nof pirates who reign over this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stand before a living legend, the\Nmost revered pirate who ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the great Captain Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you know that plotting an attack\Non this island would mean certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.45,0:07:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My army of 80 million super mean pirate\Nsoldiers would squash you like bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect us to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.61,0:07:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I have been so dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I practically told her I was lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.13,0:07:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you, you crafty tactician!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,80 million may have been an exaggeration,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have a great many\Nmen under my control!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess is three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She does know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.89,0:08:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you guys going? Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, or I'll shut it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a proud man, and I won't stand for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your last warning, or you'll\Nget to see why they call me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.35,0:08:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proud Usopp, and not pushover Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already seen for yourself\Njust how good I am with this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.45,0:08:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you know I can rival\Nanyone carrying a pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.67,0:08:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've drawn your\Npistol, are you willing to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guns aren't for threats,\Nthey're for actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:08:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to risk your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real pirates definitely\Nhave a lot more punch behind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their words because they\Ncan actually back them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole that. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole those words from\NRed-Haired Shanks, a pirate I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know Red-Haired Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are a real pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.33,0:09:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you gotta be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.83,0:09:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really know him? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know your dad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name's Yasopp, right? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My old man's name is Yasop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.81,0:10:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how, uh, how in the\Nworld do you know him?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.43,0:10:06.36,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(433,474,\1a&H00&)}{Village Restaurant - Funi}Village Diner{Z - does this need a glossary entry?}
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.43,0:10:06.36,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(433,474,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}{Village Restaurant - Funi}Village Diner{Z - does this need a glossary entry?}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:02.43,0:10:06.36,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}{Village Restaurant - Funi}Village Diner{Z - does this need a glossary entry?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.33,0:10:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I met your dad when\NI was just a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, does my old\Nman really know Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I met your dad, he\Nwas part of Shanks' crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they were probably pretty good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.61,0:10:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.15,0:10:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My old man's sailing the high\Nseas with famous pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard from him in a while,\Nbut I bet he's still with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a heck of a sharpshooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd keep him on my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Good shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, that's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:11:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could shoot an ant between\Nthe eyes from across town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.55,0:11:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know something, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a kid named Usopp, and\Nhe's just about your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told me about him\Nalready, a hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.59,0:11:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It broke my heart to\Nleave, but I had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Luffy, when the pirate flag\Nbeckons, you must hate its call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.73,0:11:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used to go on and on\Nand on about his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I heard enough about\Nyou to make my ears bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you,\Nhe was a great pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure am proud of my old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He leapt into a pirate's\Nlife on the endless sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And chose a life of real adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:11:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know someone who could\Nprovide us with a decent ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or even anyone who knows\Nhow to sail for that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a pretty small village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I just don't think\Nwe'll be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about that huge mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one on top of that hill over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know the Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.21,0:12:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all that money, surely\Nthey can help us get our boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered something\Nthat I really gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.71,0:12:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows me at this place,\Nso stay and eat as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why was he in such a\Nhurry to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is\Nthe place they took him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those terrible\Npirates dragged him inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now it's up to us to save our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But guys, those are real pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if they've grilled\Nand eaten him already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.47,0:12:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's grisly old witch hag to\Neat their victims, not pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.73,0:13:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be the most brutal\Nand epic battle of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.95,0:13:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must show no mercy because\Nthey'll never show it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.73,0:13:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Usopp pirates have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.99,0:13:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Usopp is gone. Did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.17,0:13:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice up, you filthy pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done with\Nour beloved captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That meat sure was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These pirates are cannibals!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done, you savages?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for your captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We ate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you punks looking at me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just had to say\Nsomething stupid, didn't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.67,0:13:57.00,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)}Village Mansion
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.67,0:13:57.00,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Village Mansion
Dialogue: 3,0:13:53.67,0:13:57.00,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Village Mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:14:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wish to see Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't start this again.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.51,0:14:06.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Kaya\NMansion Owner
Dialogue: 2,0:14:03.51,0:14:06.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Kaya\NMansion Owner
Dialogue: 3,0:14:03.51,0:14:06.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Kaya\NMansion Owner
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like talking to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.55,0:14:11.81,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(435,476,\1a&H00&)}Klahadore\NMansion Butler
Dialogue: 2,0:14:06.55,0:14:11.81,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(435,476,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Klahadore\NMansion Butler
Dialogue: 3,0:14:06.55,0:14:11.81,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Klahadore\NMansion Butler
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.17,0:14:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man is without a\Ndoubt a chronic liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.17,0:14:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For someone in your weakened state,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp's outlandish stories\Nmight be too much to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your late parents instructed me to protect\Nyou to the fullest of my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be against their wishes\Nfor you to see him, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll leave your medicine here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be sure to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killjoy will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A name I'll bear if you are kept safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, you came! Of course. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.49,0:14:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem a little down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.03,0:14:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of talking like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.41,0:15:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to invite you\Ninside like a proper guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.41,0:15:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's just no way\NKlahadore would ever allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a bad person,\Nthough. Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, I'm a brave warrior of the sea\Nwho likes endless oceans and the open sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Houses weren't made for rogues like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd probably just feel cramped in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what adventure are you\Ngoing to tell me about today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the story of me\Nfighting a giant goldfish
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the South Pole when I\Nwas only five years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.91,0:15:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goldfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A giant goldfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.73,0:15:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What first astounded me was\Nthe immense size of its poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so big that when I landed on\Nit, I thought it was solid ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like an island!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if our captain ran off at this hour,\Nthen this is the place he's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what in the world\Ndoes Usopp come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He comes to lie. To lie? That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.27,0:16:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's great, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is a liar awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Kaya,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the girl who lives there has been\Nin a terrible depression that's kept
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.27,0:16:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her weak and in bed since her\Nparents got sick and died a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's very rich, but all that money\Ncouldn't help her recover from her sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So our captain tells us special made-up\Nstories to make her laugh and cheer her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.99,0:16:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Zoro is the best at telling lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.45,0:16:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that really is pretty nice of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best thing about him\Nis his mischievous side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like him because he's\Nnot afraid to be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I like the captain's crazy lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.87,0:16:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when he tells her those\Nstories, he makes her feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, lots better. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.99,0:16:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should ask\Nher for a ship after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.23,0:16:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting in is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guards at the gate\Ndon't let anyone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.77,0:17:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go ask him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're not gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.89,0:17:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after that terrifying and\Ntraumatic little incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we escaped into the sky riding\Non a giant slingshot ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That worked well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.51,0:17:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't mind them, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This happens to me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just the price of\Nbeing a famous adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just new recruits who heard about\Nme and came to join the Usopp Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.79,0:17:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A favor from me? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if there was any\Nway you could help us get a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.09,0:18:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that this\Nis criminal trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These people are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not now, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell me all about this\Nriffraff after they've left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave now, unless you have\Nsome business with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could help us get a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certainly not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have quite the reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are very well known in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.69,0:18:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive for\Nsomeone as young as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.09,0:18:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually people who admire\Nme so much call me Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's Captain Usopp to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father also had something\Nof a reputation. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:19:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never be anything more\Nthan the son of a filthy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows what sort of\Ntrouble you're up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I ask is that you and your kind\Nleave this respectable young lady alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.41,0:19:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A filthy pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and she are from completely\Ndifferent worlds, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it money you're after?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cease this at once, Klahadore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.51,0:19:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologize to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.25,0:19:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe there is any reason to\Napologize to this savage young man, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.49,0:19:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goal isn't to slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am merely stating the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sympathize with your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must hate your\Ngreat idiot of a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For abandoning his family and his village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.75,0:19:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of his mindless lust for treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.65,0:19:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clador, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare insult\Nmy father ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.63,0:20:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have you gotten so worked up, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's times like these when you\Nshould do what you do best and lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about how your father\Nis really a traveling salesman,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or about how you aren't\Nreally related by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Case in point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He resorts to violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the apple never falls\Nfar from the tree, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.61,0:20:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.43,0:20:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father listened to his heart and\Nchose a life of risk and adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.19,0:20:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am proud to say that my old man\Nis a brave warrior of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, I have been known\Nto exaggerate from time to time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.51,0:20:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I will never lie\Nabout who my father is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to be ashamed of my heritage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.05,0:20:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the son of a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are brave warriors\Nof the sea, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.71,0:21:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite a twisted\Nway of putting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.27,0:21:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to understand that you\Nare living proof of his savage blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You run around spouting lies and use\Nviolence when you don't get your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.95,0:21:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To top it off, you cozy up to the lady\Nof the house to steal her fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong! I only...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.57,0:21:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father is a filthy, Newgate pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.93,0:21:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Treachery is in your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you would have\Nsuch an evil scheme!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't let up, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Usopp, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.47,0:21:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more violets!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.99,0:21:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.43,0:21:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lahador isn't a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just trying to do what he thinks is\Nbest for me, and sometimes he goes too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.79,0:21:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are never to come here again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.05,0:21:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me twice, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:21:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last you'll ever see of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you butler jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.99,0:22:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our captain's not that kind of guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.65,0:22:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you don't have\Na bone to pick with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.23,0:22:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bunch of dope!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull me down! Pull me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.55,0:22:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.15,0:22:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will all leave immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.01,0:22:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your meal is ready now, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.45,0:22:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.91,0:22:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cook would be most\Nupset to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.27,0:22:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He works his hardest day and night to come
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up with delicious meals\Nthat suit your needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.61,0:23:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why were you so cruel to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.85,0:23:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I was wrong to talk\Nto Usopp without telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.09,0:23:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will admit that much, and I'm very\Nsorry for not being honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.91,0:23:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this situation did not\Nwarrant that harsh treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.29,0:23:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.79,0:23:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been quite some time since\NI first arrived at this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be three years that I have\Nbeen in the service of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.61,0:23:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never forget what happened when\NI showed up at your father's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.97,0:23:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My former employers were\Nbrutal, pitiless men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.13,0:23:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had been kicked off the ship I worked\Non for some small blunder I had made,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.89,0:23:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and with no work or money, I was on\Nthe verge of dying like a beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.39,0:24:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I know, I would have\Ndied without your father's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.97,0:24:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe my life to your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.33,0:24:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that they're gone,\NI owe my life to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that it isn't my place to\Ninterfere with your friendships.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.89,0:24:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have taken such a bold step\Nunless I thought it absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.91,0:24:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that Usopp isn't exactly\Nknown for his upstanding character.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.07,0:24:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.03,0:24:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if anything were to happen to you it\Nwould be my fault for not seeing to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.69,0:24:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your safety and I would never be able\Nto ask forgiveness from your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.79,0:24:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think ill of me for my\Nchildish behavior earlier today?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.29,0:24:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.49,0:24:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thankful to have you\Naround too, Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.79,0:24:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I stand by my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:24:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp is one of the nicest people I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:24:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:25:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, he is still not welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.23,0:25:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clawhead door!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.85,0:25:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You blockhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.43,0:25:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blockhead will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.31,0:25:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd Luffy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.17,0:25:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.41,0:25:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably ran after that captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.91,0:25:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's at his secret spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.95,0:25:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, over by the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.69,0:25:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always goes there when he's\Ngoing to think something over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.47,0:25:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy can take care of himself,\Nbut where's your other friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.69,0:25:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.47,0:25:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, he just\Nup and disappears a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.39,0:25:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and then he shows up out\Nof nowhere, all freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.41,0:25:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrible news, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.75,0:25:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.03,0:25:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some nut job is on his way here\Nand he only walks backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.39,0:25:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.39,0:25:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.35,0:25:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.53,0:26:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now which one of you people\Nhas the nerve to call me weird?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.64,0:26:04.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)}Jango\NA Hypnotist
Dialogue: 2,0:25:59.64,0:26:04.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Jango\NA Hypnotist
Dialogue: 3,0:25:59.64,0:26:04.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Jango\NA Hypnotist
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.85,0:26:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a normal guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.67,0:26:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.63,0:26:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look insane. Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.85,0:26:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary\Nrun-of-the-mill hypnotist.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.65,0:26:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hypnotist? Really? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.47,0:26:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show us something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.89,0:26:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.37,0:26:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.21,0:26:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.25,0:26:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think that I\Nwould want to reveal my masterful
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.03,0:26:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hypnosis techniques to a\Nbunch of roadside strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.29,0:26:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you convinced me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.89,0:26:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now watch the ring closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.35,0:26:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.37,0:26:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, by the count of Django,\Nyou'll be in a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.67,0:26:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.61,0:26:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, Django!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.53,0:26:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this freaky weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.47,0:26:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.29,0:26:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.85,0:26:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here to be alone, but\NI guess that's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.93,0:26:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.27,0:26:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.31,0:27:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.43,0:27:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.19,0:27:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.55,0:27:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insulting my old man like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.65,0:27:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hate that guy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.53,0:27:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone says,\NYasopp is a great pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.31,0:27:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.89,0:27:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always looked up to my old man for\Nliving every day with his life on the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.57,0:27:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out in the open ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.93,0:27:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made a brave choice,\Nand I admire him for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.59,0:27:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then that stupid, snotty\Nbutler stomped all over my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.15,0:27:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna pay for this. Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.61,0:27:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know if you're ever\Ngonna see that girl again?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.57,0:27:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.99,0:27:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll consider it if that butler\Napologizes to me for the things he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.07,0:27:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That butler right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.09,0:27:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the one. If he...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.39,0:27:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is he doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.73,0:27:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a big idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.23,0:28:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jango, I specifically ordered\Nyou to keep yourself inconspicuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.01,0:28:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean sleeping in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.49,0:28:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.63,0:28:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've perfected the\Nskills of the chameleon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.89,0:28:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.25,0:28:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone else with\Nhim, and man, is he weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.11,0:28:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.51,0:28:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.42,0:28:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, have all the necessary\Npreparations been made?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.01,0:28:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.17,0:28:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can start any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.97,0:28:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the rich girl murder plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.67,0:28:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.03,0:28:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,searching for a great treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.69,0:28:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind\Nthat I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.29,0:28:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.85,0:29:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my way to that place before\Nsomeone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.65,0:29:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my\Ngrasp And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.59,0:29:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.95,0:29:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.07,0:29:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.31,0:29:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.21,0:29:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.69,0:29:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.17,0:29:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When everything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.29,0:29:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.19,0:29:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.71,0:29:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

